```
id: SPL-013
name: Windows event log cleared
description: Security log cleared (1102) or any log cleared (System 104).
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Defense Evasion
mitre_technique: T1070.001 Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs
severity: High
data_source: index=wineventlog
false_positives: Imaging and lab maintenance.
tuning: Exclude imaging servers; treat every other event as an incident.
test_method: Clear the Security log on a lab host.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=wineventlog ((sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=1102) OR (sourcetype="WinEventLog:System" EventCode=104)) earliest=-1h
| eval actor=coalesce(src_user, Subject_Account_Name, user)
| table _time host EventCode actor
| sort - _time
